<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			     3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.50 /11.40   11.85 /11.75   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>BPI			 11.60 /11.45   12.00 /11.80   12.50 /12.25</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.55 /11.45   11.95 /11.85   12.30 /12.20</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.75 /11.375  12.00 /11.75   12.5  /12.10</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.65 /11.35   11.90 /11.75   12.30 /12.125</p>
<p>PNB			 11.40 /11.30   11.805/11.775  12.05 /11.95</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.70 /11.625  11.90 /11.825  12.30 /12.225</p>
<p>StandChart		11.60 /11.50   11.90 /11.80   12.30 /12.20</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
